<title>USA: Sysco names CEOs of two units.</title>
<headline>Sysco names CEOs of two units.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sysco Corp said Monday that Richard Rose, president and chief operating officer of its unit, Sysco Food Services of Cleveland Inc, has assumed additional responsibilities as chief executive of the unit.</p>
<p>Sysco also said that William Holden, president and chief operating officer of its Hallsmith-Sysco Food Services division, has assumed the additional post of chief executive officer of the division.</p>
<p>Sysco is the largest food service marketing and distribution organization in North America.</p>
